    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál geera ar slahhaangw oo kurkú mibaá nee wak, axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, múk Tiro, múk Yerusalemu ngwa sawaaqasené' tawa kaahi, ‹Ahaá ala, Yerusalemu gixsadá' muu sleémeero ira waaraáhh, kaa hhaáf, daxta atén pa/aangw ugwa slawaán, daqaari'iimarós kaa hhitín.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, Aníng daxta nee kiíng Tiro ti araán. Xoordaá yaariir ngi tleés, inooín kiíng in i haratlayá' adór gwaanduú ma'aay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín koo/irók nee kiteeridaá tsaa'aso kay qamaamin ngi fee/iyá'. Aníng hhapeerók an paapa/aás, nee tlaa/ár kaahaar iri met. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari yaamaá kaahaar tleehhít awa baraá tla/ángw tlawi, nee múk siyoó ohiím baratsufay'ín nguri gawaadí intlaahán. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'. Xoordu iri ar tlayá' haasaáng wa alé, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee gixsadaá hatlá' awa inslaawaywók kudaá baraá aya in hhaamiís sleeme. Daqaní inooín ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, waawutmo Nebukadnesa oo múk Babuloni, waawutmoó waawitá ngu /iikú wa huúw, nee farsuuwós nee gaardaá slaqwaraaro nee slaqwaruuseedá' faras gwa i tsa/aandi, nee slaqwaruusér yaariire, Tiro ngin i haratlayá' ngiri haraweeliyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós gixsadaá inslaawaywók kudá' baraá aya giri hhaamiis. Kiíng tiri haraweel badu sleémeero adór koo/i, ufér hhape kari dalaa/ dír koo/irók, kari tuuntuuk ar gaambu as tiwa baraadií ilaa/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gufteraá koo/i fe/it gi geeraá koo/írí qaas, nee /ampuuwók awa xuuma giri fee/ ar suruúru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farsuú waawutmo Nebukadnesa ku ló'wa úr, nee teeri birnga gáwtí tleesiyé' iri tuuntúk. Koo/i iri daaraxát as kududuhoó slaqwaruusér faras gwaa i tsa/aan, nee gaardaá slaqwara nee kudá' huwaá koomá', qoomár bir darah afkú gixsaroge a adór múk daráh baraá gixsa ar dír aa fee/it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ar fuqeenaá farsuine ayaawók sleémeero gun adarah, mukók guri tsuu/ ar paánga, maraywók kudá' tlet giri yaamií daraahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaari'iimarók ngiri ar tlayá' nee umuú gaaro ar ta koonda. Koo/irók ngi fee/iyá', nee marayhúng kudá' xirfayen ki yaamií daahh, kudaá tlaa/e nee awa peehháy, nee hhapeedá' taa maraysír tlehhé' gari ku'uus baraá tlawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsimaahhír daa'aangw a hhaamiís. Afór gidandoorayhúng a male axasa'aaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuri tlaa/ár kaahaar tleéhh, tari dír baratsufaay kway intlaahan, nee ti malé tleehhiiká. Asma anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ Tiro an babaw, «Yaamuloouusér afaá tlawi tlunaa/ír huuamaawók birnga axaasiyé', nee /aa/aá múk taa slahh'eemisi, nee kudá' taa tsu/i afor'ín barka axaás tari daaraxaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawitá sleémeero kuduú yaamaá afaá tlawi tari huuhu'ún gawaá kiteeri'ín kudaá waawuti'iimaro, nee him'er'ín ngiri gweeriyá', tlabaaín kudaá ilaiwa/ame taa parootuús ngi duuxiyá'. Inooín daér yaariir giri eér, tari yaamií iwiit, inooín qooma sleémeerowo tari daaraax nee tari ló'wa da'ayuut daanduú tí iga sleeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín tiri satsuunqumiis ar afór ur, tari ooi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Asma anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, Kiíng Tiro i sluhhi tleéhh adór gixsadaá muu iwa lóh, qoomár ma'aay birnga baraá iltá wa huúw, nee ma'aá yaariir iri tuuntuukiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kiíng in /aytiís baraá bohoongw as iwa haragaas amór mukdá' baraadá' i dirií', kuduú aáng. Tari baraadá' wa hót ay alhhe'eesáy wasle, múk baraawók i hotaá áw i kaahh, nee pa/aangw u sleeraaká baraá yaamaá múk slafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kiíng i gár dae tlaaq tleéhh, an sangw baloó deerutká. Tam ti leelehhtuú aya ti baloó slayká. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
